\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Device and materials context. (a), (b) The compared capacitor stacks differ mainly in their electrode/interface design. (c) GIXRD confirms ferroelectric-phase formation in the Hf$_{0.5}$Zr$_{0.5}$O$_2${} films. (d) Polarization and interfacial-chemistry context from the source manuscript motivate the interface-focused interpretation used in this four-page version.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
