\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Single-process relaxation evidence. The CMW roll-off, differential loss, and Cole--Cole response are all consistent with a single-Debye relaxation, giving $f_{c}=179$~kHz for Stack~A and $f_{c}=1.4$~kHz for Stack~B.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
